<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "begin a rite: derive the head's tree, spend its lei, rest the guest half"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.rite.begins", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.rite.begins"
