uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.rite.begins"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.rite.begins ~ begin ~ rite-begin in the vessel

`lares rite begin rite=<rite> branch=<name> head=<commit>` runs `rite-begin` in the vessel: it derives the head's tree, returns the rite's lei (a kūkulu: each lent face's own) and rests the guest half of the tessera. A keep adds `staging=<path>`, the bundle it staged inside its workspace; a kūkulu names `image=`, the image the host made, and `supersedes=` the halves it sets down first (comma-joined tesserae).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ begin

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`begin` params=`rite/kukulu branch/main head/<commit> ~ begin a kūkulu at a head`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ rite · branch · head · staging · image · supersedes · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`rite` params=`takes/rite needs/required ~ the rite: kukulu or keep`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`branch` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the lei's line`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`head` params=`takes/commit needs/required ~ the head the rite begins at`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`staging` params=`takes/path ~ a keep's staged bundle inside its workspace`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`image` params=`takes/digest ~ the image the host made`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`supersedes` params=`takes/tesserae ~ the begun halves set down first, comma-joined`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ one face, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ spends the strung lei, which carries the grant`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · rite-malformed · rite-begun-stands · rite-tree-unreadable · lent-faces-empty · swarm-lei-absent · face-log-unreadable

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.rite.begins rite/kukulu branch/main head/<commit>]] ~ the rite, branch or head missing, or a malformed face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rite-malformed` params=`~ the rite names no rite the vessel knows`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rite-begun-stands` params=`~ a begun half already stands; land or abandon it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rite-tree-unreadable` params=`~ the head's tree reads nowhere`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`lent-faces-empty` params=`~ no face lent a line to the rite`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`swarm-lei-absent` params=`~ no lei stands strung for the line`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-log-unreadable` params=`~ a face's log reads nowhere`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

